          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Why?",
          "start": 363.14,
          "end": 363.64,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because he told them to abandon their practices that they inherited from their parents.",
