          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Heaven.\"",
          "start": 3956.884,
          "end": 3957.213,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, for, for the Hereafter, we need to fatten ourselves as much as possible.",
