          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For example, in Wudu, God gave us four steps.",
      "start": 4738.303,
      "end": 4740.728,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "For",
