          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "think.",
          "start": 4824.423,
          "end": 4824.665,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, I'll tell you something.",
