          "end": 5266.508,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For example, our parents taught us to say \"Muhammad, 'Ale Muhammad, Ibrahim, 'Ale Ibrahim\" in the Prayer.",
      "start": 5266.508,
      "end": 5272.03,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
